    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Across the whole packet, policy debate follows one dominant pattern shown by the cited source.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_7deae2b86449db97\",\"quote\":\"May I, through the Minister, thank the Secretary of State for her reply to me regarding the application for a university technical college in Doncaster…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_5da506ffa66a1a6e\",\"quote\":\"We are making progress on the independent mental health and employers review…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_d07613336a288d46\",\"quote\":\"I hope my hon. Friend will join me in sharing the sentiments of our hon. Friend the Member for Fareham…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_149b9b80a7c26c2d\",\"quote\":\"I am happy to confirm that, but I am also happy to point out how important Scotland is to the rest of the UK…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_149b9b80a7c26c2d\",\"quote\":\"This treaty shows there are many other potential costs to a hard Brexit; for example, in respect of the protection of the rights of citizens who otherwise may also find that they face additional burdens…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_149b9b80a7c26c2d\",\"quote\":\"That is what the Bill will do. The hon. Member for Stone (Sir William Cash) did not want to be held to anything, but is it not about time the UK Government were held to at least some things that they are going to do in the future\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_149b9b80a7c26c2d\",\"quote\":\"Although SNP Members are keen to support the approval of these draft decisions, the very nature of the Bill shows us how deep and wide our current protections are in the EU…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_149b9b80a7c26c2d\",\"quote\":\"I believe that many people in all parts of this Chamber are as passionate about dignity, freedoms and protections as I am and as we in the SNP are. Whatever the future holds, it will be important for those voices to make themselves heard…\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"The cited excerpts discuss various policy debates and concerns, but do not establish a single, dominant pattern across the entire 'packet' of policy.\",\"mechanism\":\"Misinterpretation of evidence; drawing a broad conclusion from limited, disparate sources.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim is overly assertive and lacks evidentiary support, potentially misleading the reader about the nature of policy discourse.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The claim could be valid if a comprehensive analysis of all relevant sources demonstrated a consistent pattern, but the provided excerpts do not support this. Active investigation would be needed. ACTIVE INVESTIGATION REQUIRED. ACTIVE INVESTIGATION REQUIRED. ACTIVE INVESTIGATION REQUIRED.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The evidence presented demonstrates a range of policy discussions, but no single, dominant pattern is evident across all excerpts. The initial claim makes an unwarranted generalization based on this limited evidence.\"}",
